{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05146","headline":"酬燕公出湖见寄 · 赵冬曦","name":"酬燕公出湖见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纶綍有成命，旌麾不可攀。\n湘川朝目断，荆阙夕波还。\n果枉东瞻唱，兴言夕放闲。\n携琴仙洞中，置酒㴩湖上。\n芳景恣行乐，谪居忽如忘。\n聚散本相因，离情自悲怅。\n鸾翮非常戢，鹏天会昭旷。\n永怀宛洛游，曾是弹冠望。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵冬曦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05146.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05146","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}